{"abstract":[{"text":"실기기가 없어도 끝까지 갈 수 있게, 진짜 손보다 가짜 손을 먼저 만듭니다.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-0-Project-Setup","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-2-Pose-Features","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-3-Reference-Poses","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-4-Scoring-and-Coaching","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide"],"anchor":"튜토리얼","title":"튜토리얼","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"1.1","anchor":"11","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"왜 가짜 손이 먼저인가."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" 시뮬레이터에는 손 스켈레톤 앵커가 오지 않습니다. 실기기를 전제로 만들면 Vision Pro가 없는 사람은 첫 화면도 못 봅니다. 그래서 데이터가 들어오는 "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"구멍"}]},{"type":"text","text":"을 먼저 정의하고, 그 구멍에 가짜 데이터를 흘려 넣습니다."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HandSample.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 17–21행"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["protocol HandFeed: AnyObject {","    var samples: AsyncStream<HandSample> { get }","    func start() async","    func stop()","}"]},{"anchor":"12","level":3,"text":"1.2","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"한 프레임 분량의 손 정보를 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HandSample"},{"type":"text","text":"로 정의합니다. 실기기 경로와 가짜 경로가 "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"같은 타입","type":"text"}]},{"text":"을 내보내는 것이 핵심입니다. 나중에 진짜 손을 붙일 때 뒷단을 하나도 고치지 않아도 됩니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HandSample.swift"},{"text":" 6–14행","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct HandSample {","    var feature: PoseFeature","    var chirality: HandAnchor.Chirality","    \/\/\/ 오버레이 정렬용. 목 데이터에서는 nil.","    var wristTransform: simd_float4x4?","    \/\/\/ 손목에서 중지 너클까지의 거리. 오버레이 크기 보정에 쓴다.","    var handSpan: Float","    var timestamp: TimeInterval","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"13","text":"1.3"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"먼저 다룰 자모 40자를 정의합니다. 한국수화사전(2005) 기준으로 자음 19자, 모음 21자입니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"code":"Jamo.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 4–15행","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["enum Jamo: String, CaseIterable, Identifiable, Sendable {","    \/\/ 자음 19","    case giyeok = \"ㄱ\", ssangGiyeok = \"ㄲ\", nieun = \"ㄴ\", digeut = \"ㄷ\", ssangDigeut = \"ㄸ\"","    case rieul = \"ㄹ\", mieum = \"ㅁ\", bieup = \"ㅂ\", ssangBieup = \"ㅃ\", siot = \"ㅅ\"","    case ssangSiot = \"ㅆ\", ieung = \"ㅇ\", jieut = \"ㅈ\", ssangJieut = \"ㅉ\", chieut = \"ㅊ\"","    case kieuk = \"ㅋ\", tieut = \"ㅌ\", pieup = \"ㅍ\", hieut = \"ㅎ\"","","    \/\/ 모음 21","    case a = \"ㅏ\", ae = \"ㅐ\", ya = \"ㅑ\", yae = \"ㅒ\", eo = \"ㅓ\", e = \"ㅔ\", yeo = \"ㅕ\", ye = \"ㅖ\"","    case o = \"ㅗ\", wa = \"ㅘ\", wae = \"ㅙ\", oe = \"ㅚ\", yo = \"ㅛ\"","    case u = \"ㅜ\", weo = \"ㅝ\", we = \"ㅞ\", wi = \"ㅟ\", yu = \"ㅠ\"","    case eu = \"ㅡ\", ui = \"ㅢ\", i = \"ㅣ\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"1.4","anchor":"14","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"가짜 손은 기준 포즈 주위에서 미세하게 떨리는 값을 90Hz로 내보냅니다. 중지 관절 하나에는 일부러 오차를 실어 둡니다. 나중에 채점이 이 오차를 잡아내는지 확인하는 데 씁니다."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"관련 코드 — ","type":"text"},{"code":"MockHandFeed.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 51–63행"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    private func perturb(_ base: PoseFeature, phase: Float) -> HandSample {","        var bend = base.bend","        let jitter: Float = 0.02","        for i in bend.indices { bend[i] += sin(phase + Float(i)) * jitter }","        if bend.count > 6 { bend[7] += injectedError }   \/\/ 중지 중간 관절","","        let f = PoseFeature(bend: bend, spread: base.spread, palmNormal: base.palmNormal)","        return HandSample(feature: f,","                          chirality: .right,","                          wristTransform: nil,","                          handSpan: 0.09,","                          timestamp: CACurrentMediaTime())","    }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"15","text":"1.5","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"굽힘각 15개를 화면에 그대로 찍어 봅니다. 숫자가 흐르면 1단계 성공입니다. 이 숫자가 이후 모든 계산의 원재료입니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"관련 코드 — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockHandFeed.swift"},{"text":" 51–63행","type":"text"}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    private func perturb(_ base: PoseFeature, phase: Float) -> HandSample {","        var bend = base.bend","        let jitter: Float = 0.02","        for i in bend.indices { bend[i] += sin(phase + Float(i)) * jitter }","        if bend.count > 6 { bend[7] += injectedError }   \/\/ 중지 중간 관절","","        let f = PoseFeature(bend: bend, spread: base.spread, palmNormal: base.palmNormal)","        return HandSample(feature: f,","                          chirality: .right,","                          wristTransform: nil,","                          handSpan: 0.09,","                          timestamp: CACurrentMediaTime())","    }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","text":"실행 결과","anchor":"%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EA%B2%B0%EA%B3%BC","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1단계를 마치면 나오는 화면"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"step1.jpg","type":"image"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS 26.2 시뮬레이터에서 직접 캡처"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"체크포인트","anchor":"%EC%B2%B4%ED%81%AC%ED%8F%AC%EC%9D%B8%ED%8A%B8"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"text":"여기까지 하면","anchor":"%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%95%98%EB%A9%B4"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"창에 bend[0]…bend[14] 값이 흐른다"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"손 크기와 좌우가 표시된다","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"안 되면 확인할 것","level":4,"anchor":"%EC%95%88-%EB%90%98%EB%A9%B4-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%A0-%EA%B2%83"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"숫자가 안 나오면 ","type":"text"},{"code":".task { await feed.start() }","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"가 붙어 있는지 확인하세요."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockHandFeed"},{"type":"text","text":"는 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@MainActor"},{"type":"text","text":"입니다. 다른 액터에서 부르면 컴파일 에러가 납니다."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"계속하기","level":3,"anchor":"%EA%B3%84%EC%86%8D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-2-Pose-Features","isActive":true}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-1-Mock-Hand","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"1. 가짜 손부터 만든다"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor"]]},"references":{"doc://JihwaTutor/d